  "extract_html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"ib-wrap\" style=\"width:400px\">\n   \n<aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-darkgreen pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"Box title\">Kinetic Absorption Field</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/8/8b/La_tortue_the_flash.gif/revision/latest?cb=20180616041432\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"La tortue the flash\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/8/8b/La_tortue_the_flash.gif/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/350?cb=20180616041432\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/8/8b/La_tortue_the_flash.gif/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/350?cb=20180616041432 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/8/8b/La_tortue_the_flash.gif/revision/latest?cb=20180616041432 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"La tortue the flash\" width=\"270\" height=\"152\" data-image-key=\"La_tortue_the_flash.gif\" data-image-name=\"La tortue the flash.gif\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Russell Glosson, alias the Turtle (The Flash) can project a field that transfers surrounding kinetic energy into himself, immobilizing most if not everything else.</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Row 1 info\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Power/Ability to:</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Project a field that absorbs kinetic energy.</div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<p>The power to <b>project a field that absorbs kinetic energy</b>. Variation of <a href=\"/wiki/Effect_Field_Projection\" title=\"Effect Field Projection\">Effect Field Projection</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Kinetic_Energy_Absorption\" title=\"Kinetic Energy Absorption\">Kinetic Energy Absorption</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Capabilities\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Capabilities</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Applications\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Applications</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Associations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Associations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Limitations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Limitations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Known_Users\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Users</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Capabilities\">Capabilities</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FKinetic_Absorption_Field%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The user can generate a field that absorbs kinetic energy, potentially causing everything inside the field to either slow down or stop. It can even be done to drain the kinetic energy of particles, causing the temperature inside the field to drop to near-Absolute Zero. In most cases, these fields can vary in shape, size and range, though they are often spherical, and can be made to selectively target specific subjects, including entities, objects, powers, concepts, etc., or be made to target everything inside them, affecting entire areas indiscriminately.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Applications\">Applications</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FKinetic_Absorption_Field%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Acceleration_Negation\" title=\"Acceleration Negation\">Acceleration Negation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Binding\" title=\"Binding\">Binding</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Body_Immobilization\" title=\"Body Immobilization\">Body Immobilization</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Inanimation\" title=\"Inanimation\">Inanimation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Molecular_Deceleration\" title=\"Molecular Deceleration\">Molecular Deceleration</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Molecular_Inhibition\" title=\"Molecular Inhibition\">Molecular Inhibition</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Motion_Cancellation\" title=\"Motion Cancellation\">Motion Cancellation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Speed_Cancellation\" title=\"Speed Cancellation\">Speed Cancellation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Speed_Reduction\" title=\"Speed Reduction\">Speed Reduction</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Paralysis_Inducement\" title=\"Paralysis Inducement\">Paralysis Inducement</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Kinetic_Energy_Absorption\" title=\"Kinetic Energy Absorption\">Kinetic Energy Absorption</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Kinetic_Conversion\" title=\"Kinetic Conversion\">Kinetic Conversion</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Power_Absorption\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Power Absorption\">Power Absorption</a> (limited to kinetic energy-based powers)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Freezing\" title=\"Freezing\">Freezing</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Associations\">Associations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FKinetic_Absorption_Field%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Effect_Field_Projection\" title=\"Effect Field Projection\">Effect Field Projection</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Entrapment_Field_Projection\" title=\"Entrapment Field Projection\">Entrapment Field Projection</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Isolation_Field_Generation\" title=\"Isolation Field Generation\">Isolation Field Generation</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Absorption\" title=\"Energy Absorption\">Energy Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Conversion\" title=\"Energy Conversion\">Energy Conversion</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Force-Field_Manipulation\" title=\"Force-Field Manipulation\">Force-Field Manipulation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Force-Field_Imprisonment\" title=\"Force-Field Imprisonment\">Force-Field Imprisonment</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Force-Field_Generation\" title=\"Force-Field Generation\">Force-Field Generation</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Kinetic_Activation\" title=\"Kinetic Activation\">Kinetic Activation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Kinetic_Charging\" title=\"Kinetic Charging\">Kinetic Charging</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Kinetic_Energy_Manipulation\" title=\"Kinetic Energy Manipulation\">Kinetic Energy Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Motion_Lock\" title=\"Motion Lock\">Motion Lock</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Stillness_Inducement\" title=\"Stillness Inducement\">Stillness Inducement</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Telekinesis\" title=\"Telekinesis\">Telekinesis</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Ergo-Telekinesis\" title=\"Ergo-Telekinesis\">Ergo-Telekinesis</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Force-Field_Telekinesis\" title=\"Force-Field Telekinesis\">Force-Field Telekinesis</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Kineti-Telekinesis\" title=\"Kineti-Telekinesis\">Kineti-Telekinesis</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Telekinetic_Aura\" title=\"Telekinetic Aura\">Telekinetic Aura</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Telekinetic_Force_Manipulation\" title=\"Telekinetic Force Manipulation\">Telekinetic Force Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Telekinetic_Tethering\" title=\"Telekinetic Tethering\">Telekinetic Tethering</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Vector_Telekinesis\" title=\"Vector Telekinesis\">Vector Telekinesis</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Tractor_Beam_Emission\" title=\"Tractor Beam Emission\">Tractor Beam Emission</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Potential_Energy_Manipulation\" title=\"Potential Energy Manipulation\">Potential Energy Manipulation</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Limitations\">Limitations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FKinetic_Absorption_Field%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D4&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>May be in-selective, affecting everything/everyone inside the field whether user wants to or not.</li>\n<li>Users with <a href=\"/wiki/Speedster_Physiology\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Speedster Physiology\">Speedster Physiology</a> can counter this.</li>\n<li>Without a source of motion, ability becomes useless.</li>\n<li>There maybe intervals between the effective emission of the field.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorption_Immunity\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Absorption Immunity\">Absorption Immunity</a>/<a href=\"/wiki/Absorption_Negation\" title=\"Absorption Negation\">Absorption Negation</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Known_Users\">Known Users</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FKinetic_Absorption_Field%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D5&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>The Turtle/Russell Glosson (<i>The Flash/Arrowverse</i>)</li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/scp-1548\">SCP-1548 - The Star, the Hateful</a> (<i>SCP Foundation</i>)</li>\n<li>Gauss (<i>Warframe</i>)</li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260804181709\nCache expiry: 1209600\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.026 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.039 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 129/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 89/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 203/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   11.581      1 Template:Infobox\n100.00%   11.581      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_powerlisting:pcache:idhash:306305-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260804181709 and revision id 2868171. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>",
